acceptance_criteria:
- Pager volume for the SLO-linked alert group reduces by >= 60% during transient spikes without increasing mean time to resolution for true incidents;
- Automated evacuation can be triggered safely by automation with a single approver/fast-path and includes an automatic rollback plan;
- Skeletal runbook is < 8 steps and validated by two on-call rotations;
- New suppression/smoothing logic emits debug traces to the Console and is covered by unit + integration tests;
- No customer-facing error-budget burn > 10% in the two-week canary after rollout.
